  "description": "AOS-714 / CAD-2710: shared valid and invalid cases for an enum view param's optional `labels`. Both readers wrap each `view` as the only entry of a screen's `views`, with navigation sections [customers, reports], and read it: Cadence cadence-core app_screen_decl validate_map, hosted apps/api readScreenViews. Keep this file byte-identical in both repos. Cases that need raw JSON (a repeated key) cannot be written here and are covered by the Cadence tests only.",
